UID:launch-0c26b3d4-43e3-4c1a-8976-592ff319bc51@readout
DTSTAMP:20270330T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270330
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270331
SUMMARY:Launch: Nova-C IM-3
DESCRIPTION:Falcon 9 · SpaceX This is the third mission to the Moon for I
 ntuitive Machines with its Nova-C lunar lander. It is to deliver 130 kg o
 f payloads to the lunar surface. This mission also includes a rideshare p
 ossibility due to available excess capacity on the launch vehicle. (no ea
 rlier than this date) Source: Launch Library 2 (The Space Devs).
LOCATION:Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA
URL:https://ll.thespacedevs.com/2.3.0/launches/0c26b3d4-43e3-4c1a-8976-592
 ff319bc51/
